message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below, and cite cBioPortal, the MC3 call set and the TCGA studies you used."
title: "Precision Oncology AI Platform"
abstract: "Research platform for somatic mutation data: MAF checks, tumour mutational burden, substitution profiles, cohort statistics and a calibrated tumour-type classifier with abstention, evaluated with patient-grouped cross-validation on public TCGA data. Research use only."
